# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# BUSINESS DATA — never goes into git.
# This is the shop's live records and photos. It lives only on
# the machine that runs the app, and is backed up by copying the
# folder (see the User Guide), not by git.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
velvet-fox-data.json
velvet-fox-data.json.tmp
/photos/
/backups/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Client-only — lives only on the shop's Mac, copied there by hand.
# A one-liner that runs `git pull` in the app folder.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Update Velvet Fox.command

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OS / editor noise
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
~$*
*.tmp
